WEBVTT

00:01:24.755 --> 00:01:30.494
About two to three children
out of 1,000 in the United States

00:01:30.518 --> 00:01:32.025
have cerebral palsy.

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:36.544
I do not know the statistics
for my country and continent,

00:01:36.568 --> 00:01:39.171
because there's not much documentation.

00:01:39.996 --> 00:01:43.603
Maybe this could be the journey
that changes everything.

00:01:44.785 --> 00:01:46.535
We named him Lubuto,

00:01:46.559 --> 00:01:49.375
a beautiful Zambian name
from my Lunda tribe

00:01:49.399 --> 00:01:51.820
of the Bemba-speaking people,

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.190
meaning "light."

00:01:55.028 --> 00:01:57.649
By the time he was seven months,

00:01:58.561 --> 00:02:00.524
Lubuto's physical impairment